// appservice-http-5xx.kql
// Where : Log Analytics (log-uniqa) -> Logs. Table fed by the Web App diagnostic setting (AppServiceHTTPLogs).
// What  : Front-end access log entries with status >= 500 in the last 24 h, per app and URL.
// Why   : Platform-level view of 5xx (includes errors returned before the app, e.g. 502/503 during
//         container restarts) to compare against the in-app view in app-failed-requests.kql.
AppServiceHTTPLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| where ScStatus >= 500
| project TimeGenerated, _ResourceId, CsMethod, CsUriStem, ScStatus, ScSubStatus, TimeTaken, CIp, UserAgent
| order by TimeGenerated desc
